# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization. All content in
# this repo is committed as LF; force LF on checkout too (eol=lf)
# rather than the platform-native default, since several packages
# (rlp/rlpgen, accounts/abi/bind, Go Example tests' "// Output:"
# comments, cmd/evm testdata) compare checked-out text byte-for-byte
# against LF-only generated/expected output. Without this, Windows
# runners default to CRLF conversion and break those comparisons.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sol linguist-language=Solidity
